Minimum stakes depend on bookmaker policies rather than the bet structure itself. Most operators enforce £0.10 or £0.05 minimum stakes per individual bet, translating to £30.30 or £15.15 total outlay for a 303-bet Goliath Flag. Some bookmakers set higher minimums of £0.50 or £1.00 per bet, pushing total costs to £151.50 or £303 respectively. Budget-conscious bettors should verify their bookmaker's minimum stake rules before constructing a Goliath Flag, as these multipliers can quickly exceed intended spending limits.
